 * Netfilter hook example – safely read TCP payload from both linear and
 * non‑linear parts of an skb using skb_header_pointer().
 *
 * The hook is attached to NF_INET_PRE_ROUTING (or any other appropriate
 * hook) and runs for every incoming packet.
 */
